WEBVTT

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:48.060
Hey. Lag Seeing!

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.630
I'm sorry... Please wait for just a moment.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:55.180
"The operation was a success."

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:58.120
"I'm running around in high spirits."

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:00.930
"So please, don't worry about me, Mother."

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.100
Is this right?

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:03.950
Yeah...

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:12.340
This girl's mother kept working hard until she was 
finally able to admit her into Yuusari's Hospital...

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.850
The operation was a success, right?

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:17.690
Actually, we haven't been 
able to operate yet.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.210
She's weakened...

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.700
Then this letter is... a lie?

00:02:24.350 --> 00:02:26.250
Letters of lies are no good!

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.300
Steak!

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.210
You mustn't!

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:32.750
Why not, Lag?

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.000
Because...

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.510
I don't wanna have an operation...

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.020
I want to see my mother.

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.180
But... If I write the truth in the letter...

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.100
I'll make my mom worried...

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.440
I don't have any time to be standing around.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:57.530
I've got a whole lot of letters 
for the south today, see.

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.710
Thank you for your hard work.

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:07.350
Reverse World

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:11.790
Please! These letters are important 
to everyone in the village...

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.660
Incidents of letters being stolen are 
happening in the south, one after another.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.250
Is it Noir?

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:53.250
It is not Noir acting alone.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:57.450
Bees have been attacked simultaneously 
in different places.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.110
The anti-government organization, Reverse?

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:03.620
Why is Reverse stealing letters?

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:04.920
It's because...

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:11.520
To the poor, the postal system is a symbol 
of the Amberground government's control.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:17.000
They destroy that symbol and gain support by 
revealing the powerlessness of the government.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:19.360
Well, that's what they say, anyway.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:23.060
Gauche would never participate 
in something like that.

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:29.230
Gauche Suede has been continuously 
absent from his duties.

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.910
The chance that he has lost 
his memories is quite high.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.700
So he has been dismissed.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.710
He's lost his heart.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:41.150
But that's just hear-say from Akatsuki!

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:43.610
And how do you intend to find out the truth?

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:49.040
None of us have permission to 
cross the bridge to Akatsuki.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:52.670
That'll be all.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:55.670
Sorry, but I have some other guests...

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.870
Damn that Lloyd... How long 
does he plan on making us wait?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.600
Deal with it. And put out that cigar.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.120
It stinks.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.820
W-What the hell is this?!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.580
You know the inspectors that 
are here from the capital?

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:22.300
Yes, I suppose so...

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.760
Lloyd! Lloyd!

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:26.090
Largo Lloyd!

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:32.000
Hi, Mr. Hazle Valentine, Mr. Caribs Garrard!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.670
Welcome to our Hive of Love.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.110
What an incredible failure!

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:39.950
You have utterly disappointed me!

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:44.240
It goes without saying that you should have 
prepared my favorite chocolate for me!

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.690
So what are you trying to 
pull with this pickled squid?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.680
Hazle...

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:49.800
Hazle...

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:50.670
Move!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.290
I'm glad to see you again, Mr. Garrard.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.420
How long do you intend to make us wait for 
the reports on the Reverse investigation.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.750
The reports are right here.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:06.000
There are probably more than you 
can read through in a day or two...

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:08.310
Is that all of 'em?

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:09.770
Hazle!

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:15.370
Master...

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:18.790
Wait, those two are Garrard and Valentine!

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:23.950
You're right! Back then, 
we all idolized them!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.530
Thirteen years ago...

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:29.410
They are a former Letter Bee and his dingo who had moved to the capital

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:31.810
as a candidate for the next Head Bee.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:35.590
They were even my role models when I 
was running around in my youth.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.150
What's with them?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.280
Your tail?!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.690
Wasiolka!

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:11.730
Yes! Good, good... I see, I see... I get it.

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:13.890
Hey, that tickles!

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:15.260
Cut it out!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:18.710
Hey, Zazie... It's about Reverse...

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:27.130
H-H-H-H-He's... To Wa-wa-wa... 
To Wa-Wasiolka....

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:33.890
I don't really get you, but... 
Niche, rescue Wasiolka!

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:41.850
This guy's...

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.490
Not bad.

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:44.190
However...

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:48.940
In the end, you're a second rate dingo!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.050
I am not seconrate!

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.430
So you're Lag Seeing...

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:59.850
The Bee with a Spirit Amber 
implanted as his left eye...

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.830
Rumors of you have reached the capital.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:04.350
The capital?

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:06.580
You came from Akatsuki?

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:07.850
Yes.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.240
Oh, Moc Sullivan!

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:22.090
I was attacked by Reverse, and 
323 letters are irretrievable...

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.360
Please register them as "Cold Letters."

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:34.030
Was that girl's letter also...

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.700
It fell into the bottom of a 
ravine. There's no way to get it.

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.810
I'm going to head to the south!

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.200
To search for the letters!

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:46.240
I can't give you permission to do that.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:53.290
We are investigating those responsible 
for the Reverse incidents.

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:56.220
Everything dealing with Reverse 
comes under our jurisdiction.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.000
You have no qualifications 
to cross arms with Reverse.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.470
Therefore, you are forbidden 
from entering the south.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:05.660
But what about our delivering duties?

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:09.780
Reverse has detailed information on 
delivery routes, times, and the like.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:13.610
There's a possibility that this 
information is being leaked from here.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.900
Only I knew of it.

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.810
I was ambushed on my own secret route.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.370
That is all.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.550
Let's leave this incident to those guys.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:39.010
But I will find Noir 
myself, that I guarantee.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:40.510
Yes.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:44.550
I guess we'll be running 
out of tobacco pretty soon.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:51.170
Damn it! It's sour!

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:55.320
Sheesh! And this stupid curly 
little... What a disappointment!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:10:00.700
A bit more than 300... That should 
be plenty for our experiment.

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.330
Damn sour!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.700
Niche...

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:11.390
I've got to find that letter myself somehow.

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:21.920
There was a big noise, and then 
a rock broke off the cliff...

00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:24.810
Without that path, it's really 
going to be difficult.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.660
Please hurry and repair it!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:28.490
That is not our business.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:28.940
What?

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:33.090
Listen carefully. Do not 
speak about Reverse again.

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:36.770
And... Is there no path down 
to the bottom of the ravine?

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:37.750
No...

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.200
Disappointing!

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.320
Out of my way.

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:48.550
Are you okay?

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:50.270
Lag Seeing?

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.500
Why are you here?

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.240
Are you hurt?

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.670
N-No...

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.470
Go back to the Bee Hive.

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:00.160
Heading into the south is not allowed!

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:01.550
But...

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:05.510
Were you trying to tell him something?

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.020
There's a path.

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:10.690
You can go down the ravine.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:14.700
Now...

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.510
Mr. Garrard, you were a Bee?

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:21.340
And now you're in the capital?

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:25.980
I was aiming to be the 
best, to be the Head Bee...

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:29.640
Then you must also know Gauche Suede, yes?

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:32.800
I'd like to know what happened to him.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.540
Gauche Suede?

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.960
They're scattered everywhere...

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:47.510
Let's see what you can do, Lag Seeing...

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:51.900
Collect all the letters, and 
no help from your dingo.

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:56.110
If you are successful, I'll 
let you hear about Gauche.

00:11:57.260 --> 00:11:58.710
Understood!

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.860
Niche, stay here.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:05.330
This'll be perfect!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.740
Now we don't have to do any work!

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:14.900
Interesting.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.500
Your hair is a weapon?

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.750
I'm not talking to you.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.130
You're not talking to me, you say?

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.450
But you just did.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:25.550
I am not!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.390
See, there you go again.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.740
What's with that face?

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:34.300
You wanna get me, huh?

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:38.080
You'd be better off giving 
up! You can't beat me!

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:41.350
That's 'cause I'm a first-rate dingo!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:46.240
I'm a firsrate dingo too, you!

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.730
Hold it, beard-brain!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.310
Huh? Where's Niche?

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:54.910
Dunno... Getting some exercise?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:59.000
Um... This is only about half of them.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.420
Good work. Keep it up until you get them all.

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:04.740
I'm a bit worried about gaichuu showing up.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:06.860
Do you carry a shindanjuu?

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.520
This is a normal gun.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:12.220
I can't shoot a shindan any longer.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.830
Why is it that you are a letter carrier?

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:20.480
Because I want to deliver the heart 
that's contained within them.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.480
No matter what kind of heart that is?

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:27.010
Delivering letters does not 
mean just delivering happiness.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:32.300
You'll be delivering letters filled with 
hatred, sadness, or resentment sometimes...

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:36.350
When I began to doubt delivering that heart,

00:13:36.350 --> 00:13:38.550
my own heart began to decrease.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:41.090
And that's why I can no 
longer shoot a shindan.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:44.550
Well, not all letters are like that.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.840
The letter you are searching for is one.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.770
That letter you wrote for 
someone, filled with lies...

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:56.620
Fighting gaichuu, wearing away your own 
heart, all to deliver a heart of lies...

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.590
Is there any meaning to that?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.860
I'm sure that Gauche began 
thinking that way, and then...

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:04.360
I-I'm going to gather up the letters!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.540
An experiment.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:20.120
Catalyze heart using fragments 
of Spirit Amber...

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:48.960
I guess when the master is 
second-rate, so is the dingo!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:51.010
Lag is not seconrate!

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.750
The experiment's started.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:09.800
Four Roses!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.890
Why is one in a place like this?

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:14.220
Niche!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:15.800
Leave it to me!

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.220
Because I'm firsrate!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.910
The experiment was a success, I see.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:25.900
It reacted to the large number 
of letters and the Spirit Amber.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:31.650
We now have the ability to call a gaichuu 
away from its territory in the future.

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.760
It's out of that Bee's league, yes?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.490
Think he'll run?

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.950
He's going to fight it.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.160
For the letters.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.660
But in the end, fear will change your heart.

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:47.420
Hearts are things that can change.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.290
Shindan loaded!

00:15:50.230 --> 00:15:51.420
Red Needle!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.110
Huh? The memories of that glass bottle?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:12.610
I was one of the inventors of the airships, 
and I should have entered the capital, Akatsuki.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.360
But what happened there,

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:19.710
was an experiment only for the benefit 
of the few that live in the capital.

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:22.370
I was sacrificed!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:23.790
Experiment?

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.380
These people... Are they...

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:29.070
Crossing people with all manner of things...

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:31.450
Creatures with amplified heart!

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:35.850
In other words, it was an experiment 
to create man-made Spirit!

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:38.020
But their plan hit a roadblock!

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.860
Thus the failed creations were killed,

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:42.890
or thrown away, and only a few remained.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.910
That's a lie! The government would never...

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:46.900
Gauche...

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.330
One who was not able to become Spirit!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:51.570
We are living proof!

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:56.090
Stand against it! Uncover 
the truth of the government!

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.190
Steal their letters,

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.580
and that will become our weapon!

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.080
We are Reverse!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:04.470
Reverse!

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:06.550
Back to the proper order of things!

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:07.800
Reverse!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.100
Reverse!

00:17:14.120 --> 00:17:15.400
Gauche...

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:18.260
He's really in Reverse?

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:21.500
You left the bottle there are purpose, huh?

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.890
In order to show him the 
truth behind Reverse...

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:27.460
Hearts are weak and can break easily.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.460
He can't shoot anymore.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:30.660
Lag!

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:44.420
I'm going to deliver that letter...

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:47.160
Because even if the words are lies...

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:51.170
I know the heart within 
it will be understood!

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:54.420
I'm going to deliver it!

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.800
Lag!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.470
Shindan, loaded!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.770
Red Needle!

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:21.040
You said it wasn't allowed... But 
I'm going to deliver these letters.

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:27.500
Because letters have a great deal of heart, 
hope, and wishes contained within them!

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:32.910
No matter what the danger, I will 
deliver these precious letters.

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:35.750
Because that is the job of a Letter Bee!

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:39.250
Suit yourself.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:54.200
The experiments catalyzing heart using 
Spirit Amber and luring gaichuu...

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:55.730
Both were a success.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.650
Excellent work.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:00.820
As expected of the Marauders 
I have hidden in the capital.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.050
The Bee Hive is watching the south closely.

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.330
Now would be the time...

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.340
Just as you asked, everything 
has been prepared.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.260
It begins...

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:14.460
The rebirth of Amberground... Reverse.

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:22.220
Leave for the north, Noir.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:41.050
Next: Dolly
